# ============================================================
# MedExam BCS - Environment Variables Configuration
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. NEON POSTGRES (Serverless Relational Database)
# Create a free database at: https://neon.tech
# Copy your connection string from the Neon dashboard:
# ------------------------------------------------------------
DATABASE_URL=postgres://username:password@ep-sample-pool-123456.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. UPSTASH REDIS (Serverless In-Memory Cache)
# Create a free Redis database at: https://console.upstash.com
# Copy the REST URL and Token from your Upstash database details:
# ------------------------------------------------------------
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-database.upstash.io
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=AX...your_upstash_rest_token...

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE:
# - When deployed on Vercel, add these variables in:
#   Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# - If these variables are not yet set, the application will
#   gracefully use client-side LocalStorage and PWA cache so the
#   app never fails and is 100% usable immediately.
# ============================================================
